n class="inline-block cursor-default rounded border-[0.5px] border-border-color-base px-2 leading-[23px]" style="font-size:14px"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline hover:decoration-dashed">https://api.kucoin.com</span></span><span class="ml-2" style="font-size:14px"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline hover:decoration-dashed">/api/ua/v2/market/open-interest</span></span></div></div></div><div class="ml-3 flex items-center gap-1"><button aria-label="Try it" type="button" class="ui-btn ui-btn-primary ui-btn-flex h-full max-h-14 animate-none transition-none @[998px]/environment-url:h-auto"><span role="img" class="appicon app_icon" style="font-size:14px"><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img"><path d="M416.768 202.112l1.237333 0.810667 355.413334 236.928c10.24 6.826667 19.797333 13.226667 27.136 19.114666 7.68 6.186667 16.64 14.72 21.845333 27.221334 6.826667 16.512 6.826667 35.114667 0 51.626666-5.205333 12.501333-14.208 21.034667-21.845333 27.221334a393.130667 393.130667 0 0 1-27.136 19.114666l-356.650667 237.738667c-12.544 8.405333-23.893333 15.914667-33.450667 21.12-9.6 5.205333-22.784 11.136-38.144 10.24a67.413333 67.413333 0 0 1-49.749333-26.624c-9.301333-12.288-11.648-26.538667-12.629333-37.418667-1.024-10.837333-1.024-24.448-1.024-39.552V275.797333 274.346667c0-15.104 0-28.714667 1.024-39.552 0.981333-10.88 3.328-25.173333 12.629333-37.418667a67.413333 67.413333 0 0 1 49.749333-26.624c15.36-0.896 28.544 5.034667 38.144 10.24 9.6 5.205333 20.906667 12.714667 33.450667 21.12z"></path></svg></span><span class="hidden @[500px]/environment-url:inline-block">Try it</span></button></div></div></div><div class="h-6"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-paragraph font-400 mb-6"><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">api-channel:</span><span class="text-color"><span>Public</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">api-permission:</span><span class="text-color"><span>NULL</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">api-rate-limit-pool:</span><span class="text-color"><span>Public</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">sdk-service:</span><span class="text-color"><span>UTA</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">sdk-sub-service:</span><span class="text-color"><span>Market</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">sdk-method-name:</span><span class="text-color"><span>getOpenInterest</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-shrink-0 items-center"><span class="mr-2 text-secondary">api-rate-limit-weight:</span><span class="text-color"><span>10</span></span></div></div><div class="_markdown-container_txmk1_1 mb-6"><div class="markdown-body remark-mdx"><div class="markdown-child-root admonition admonition-info" data-markdown-component="x-admonition" data-first="true" data-last="true"><div class="admonition-title admonition-title-info" style="margin-bottom:4px"><span role="img" class="appicon app_icon mr-2" style="font-size:16px"><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img"><path d="M610.133333 294.4c0-25.6-17.066667-51.2-51.2-51.2-46.933333 0-68.266667 38.4-68.266666 64 0 29.866667 17.066667 51.2 51.2 51.2 38.4 0 68.266667-29.866667 68.266666-64zM422.4 665.6c-17.066667 72.533333 0 89.6 29.866667 89.6 25.6 0 98.133333-25.6 162.133333-89.6l-17.066667-21.333333c-25.6 21.333333-51.2 29.866667-59.733333 29.866666-4.266667 0-8.533333-8.533333-4.266667-34.133333l34.133334-136.533333c12.8-51.2 8.533333-81.066667-17.066667-81.066667-34.133333 0-106.666667 34.133333-174.933333 89.6l12.8 21.333333c21.333333-12.8 55.466667-29.866667 64-29.866666 4.266667 0 4.266667 8.533333 0 29.866666l-29.866667 132.266667z"></path><path d="M512 42.666667C251.733333 42.666667 42.666667 251.733333 42.666667 512s209.066667 469.333333 469.333333 469.333333 469.333333-209.066667 469.333333-469.333333S772.266667 42.666667 512 42.666667z m0 853.333333c-213.333333 0-384-170.666667-384-384s170.666667-384 384-384 384 170.666667 384 384-170.666667 384-384 384z"></path></svg></span>Description</div><div class="pl-6 markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true"><strong data-first="true" data-last="true">Historical OI (By Interval)</strong></section><div data-type="list" class="markdown-child-root"><div data-type="list-item" data-index="1" data-orderer="true" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-first="true" data-last="true"><div class="_index_1v6rr_10">1<!-- -->.</div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true"><code data-first="true">interval</code> is required.</section></div></div></div><div data-type="list" class="markdown-child-root"><div data-type="list-item" data-index="0" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-first="true" data-last="true"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6rr_18"><div class="_dash_1v6rr_28"></div></div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">Historical data is available starting from Dec 29, 2025.</section></div></div></div><table><thead><tr class=""><th>Interval</th><th>Max Retention</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=""><td>5min, 15min, 30min, 1hour, 4hour</td><td>7 days</td></tr><tr class=""><td>1day</td><td>70 days</td></tr></tbody></table><div data-type="list" class="markdown-child-root"><div data-type="list-item" data-index="2" data-orderer="true" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-first="true"><div class="_index_1v6rr_10">2<!-- -->.</div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true"><code data-first="true">symbol</code> is required and must be a single symbol (multiple symbols are not supported).</section></div></div><div data-type="list-item" data-index="3" data-orderer="true" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-last="true"><div class="_index_1v6rr_10">3<!-- -->.</div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">Pagination is supported.</section></div></div></div><div data-type="list" class="markdown-child-root"><div data-type="list-item" data-index="0" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-first="true"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6rr_18"><div class="_dash_1v6rr_28"></div></div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">You can query within a time range using <code>pageSize</code>, <code>startAt</code>, <code>endAt</code>.</section></div></div><div data-type="list-item" data-index="1" data-orderer="false" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-last="true"><div class="_unOrderContainer_1v6rr_18"><div class="_dash_1v6rr_28"></div></div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true"><code data-first="true">endAt</code> can be treated as the lastId.</section></div></div></div><section><strong data-first="true" data-last="true">Real-time OI</strong></section><div data-type="list" class="markdown-child-root" data-last="true"><div data-type="list-item" data-index="1" data-orderer="true" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-first="true"><div class="_index_1v6rr_10">1<!-- -->.</div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true"><code data-first="true">symbol</code> supports up to 10 unique symbols. If <code>symbol</code> is not specified, all symbols are returned.</section></div></div><div data-type="list-item" data-index="2" data-orderer="true" class="markdown-child-root flex" data-last="true"><div class="_index_1v6rr_10">2<!-- -->.</div><div class="markdown-child-root"><section data-first="true" data-last="true">The following filters are not effective for real-time queries: <code>startAt</code>, <code>endAt</code>, <code>pageSize</code>.</section></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-600">Request</h2><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="ui-card ui-card-bordered ui-card-small _parameters-card_qzxkk_1 _parameters-card-body_qzxkk_64"><div class="ui-card-head"><div class="ui-card-head-wrapper"><div class="ui-card-head-title">Query Params</div><div class="ui-card-extra"><button type="button" class="ui-btn ui-btn-soft-secondary ui-btn-flex ui-btn-sm"><span role="img" class="appicon app_icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="img"><path d="M606.592 86.357333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 32.426667 50.901334l-170.666667 768a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1-83.328-18.517334l170.666667-768a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 50.901333-32.426666zM328.832 268.501333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 0 60.330667L145.664 512l183.168 183.168a42.666667 42.666667 0 1 1-60.330667 60.330667l-213.333333-213.333334a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 0-60.330666l213.333333-213.333334a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 60.330667 0zM695.168 268.501333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 60.330667 0l213.333333 213.333334a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 0 60.330666l-213.333333 213.333334a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1-60.330667-60.330667L878.336 512l-183.168-183.168a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 1 0-60.330667z"></path></svg></span><span>Generate Code</span></button></div></div></div><div class="ui-card-body"><div class="flex items-center justify-center p-12"><div class="ui-skeleton ui-skeleton-active"><div class="ui-skeleton-content"><h3 class="ui-skeleton-title" style="width:38%"></h3><ul class="ui-skeleton-paragraph"><li></li><li></li><li style="width:61%"></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-8"><h2 class="mb-4 text-xl font-600">Request Code Samples</h2><div class="ui-tabs ui-tabs-top ui-tabs-button ui-tabs-full-content ui-tabs-full-content--scrollable _tabs_keaa0_1 flex"><div role="tab