ecified, all symbols are returned.\\n3. The following filters are not effective for real-time queries: `startAt`, `endAt`, `pageSize`.\\n:::\\n\\n\\n\",\"operationId\",\"sourceUrl\",[],\"auth\",{},\"responseExamples\",[],\"projectId\",345089,\"moduleId\",300305,\"folderId\",\"ordering\",\"responsibleId\",\"commonResponseStatus\",{},\"advancedSettings\",{\"_4618\":4619},\"disabledSystemHeaders\",{},\"customApiFields\",{\"_4622\":4623,\"_4624\":3495,\"_4535\":4625,\"_4536\":4626,\"_4537\":4625,\"_4539\":4627,\"_4540\":4628,\"_4541\":4629,\"_4630\":4631,\"_4538\":4632},\"9\",\"normal\",\"10\",\"Public\",\"NULL\",\"UTA\",\"Market\",\"getOpenInterest\",\"17\",\"Request Open Interest for Futures.\",10,\"oasExtensions\",\"mockScript\",{},\"createdAt\",\"2026-08-03T13:33:25.000Z\",\"updatedAt\",\"2026-09-05T14:57:43.000Z\",\"creatorId\",345075,\"editorId\",\"visibility\",\"INHERITED\",\"securityScheme\",{},\"callbacks\",\"parameters\",{\"_4650\":4651,\"_334\":4711,\"_4712\":4713,\"_4714\":4715},\"query\",[4652,4668,4689,4697,4702],{\"_158\":4653,\"_18\":4654,\"_4655\":146,\"_4573\":146,\"_19\":4656,\"_4657\":4658,\"_152\":4660,\"_4661\":4662,\"_4666\":146,\"_4667\":4658},\"hdWkGjjrz0\",\"symbol\",\"required\",\"Specifies the Futures symbols to query.\\n- **Interval Mode:**\\n  - Only **one symbol** is allowed.\\n- **Realtime Mode:**\\n  - Up to **10 symbols** may be specified.  \\n  - If not provided, the API returns real-time open interest data for **all symbols**.\",\"example\",[4659],\"XBTUSDTM\",\"array\",\"schema\",{\"_152\":4660,\"_4663\":4664},\"items\",{\"_152\":4665},\"string\",\"isCommonParameter\",\"value\",{\"_158\":4669,\"_18\":4670,\"_4655\":146,\"_4573\":146,\"_19\":4671,\"_4657\":4672,\"_152\":4665,\"_4661\":4673,\"_4666\":146,\"_4667\":4672},\"Xmh3RZA5nf\",\"interval\",\"Specifies the time interval for querying **interval-based open interest data**.\",\"5min\",{\"_152\":4665,\"_4674\":4675,\"_4681\":4682},\"enum\",[4672,4676,4677,4678,4679,4680],\"15min\",\